---
// src/components/About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">About the Tournament</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                The Sam Lower Memorial Golf Tournament celebrates Sam's life and legacy, bringing together family, friends, and the Indianapolis community in his honor. 
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-8">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 flex-shrink-0">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"></path>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Honoring Sam's Memory</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">
                    Sam Lower was passionate about golf and brought joy to everyone around him. This tournament brings together family, friends, and the greater Indianapolis community to support a good cause and celebrate his life and the positive impact he made on others.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-8">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 flex-shrink-0">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Supporting Research</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">
                    Proceeds from the tournament will benefit multiple myeloma research and support organizations helping to advance treatment and find a cure for this disease.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-blue-50 rounded-2xl p-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">Tournament Details</h3>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6">
                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6">
                    <div class="flex items-start">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4 flex-shrink-0">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Date & Time</h4>
                            <p class="text-gray-600">Friday, May 15th, 2026</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6">
                    <div class="flex items-start">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4 flex-shrink-0">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Location</h4>
                            <p class="text-gray-600">Bear Slide Golf Club</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">6770 E 231st St.<br>Cicero, IN 46034</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6">
                    <div class="flex items-start">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-purple-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4 flex-shrink-0">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Format</h4>
                            <p class="text-gray-600">Team Scramble</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6">
                    <div class="flex items-start">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-yellow-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4 flex-shrink-0">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-yellow-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Entry Fee</h4>
                            <p class="text-gray-600">$94 per person</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Includes cart</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center">
                <a href="#signup" class="inline-block bg-green-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-green-700 transition-colors">
                    Register Now
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>